OL,3,AUK needs 'credible path' on defence
OL,4,Aspending, says Nato chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FNato chief Mark Rutte has said he is
OL,7,Fconfident the UK government understands
OL,8,Fthe need for a "credible path" to
OL,9,Fincrease defence spending.
OL,11,FThe alliance's secretary general told
OL,12,Fthe BBC he was "absolutely confident"
OL,13,Fin the UK's commitment to hit a
OL,14,FNato-wide spending target of 3.5% of
OL,15,FGDP by 2035.
OL,17,FSpeaking after meetings in London, he
OL,18,Fsaid British ministers accepted the
OL,19,Fneed to make yearly steps towards
OL,20,Fhitting the target.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
